  "description": "Introducing the WIRED Cruiser - the first step-thru frame ebike in our lineup with full dual suspension! UL2849 certified with UL2271 certified batteries for unmatched comfort, accessibility, and safety.\n\nThe Cruiser features an innovative dual 60V battery system (2100Wh total capacity) and a powerful 3000W peak geared hub motor that conquers any terrain with ease.\n\nStep-Thru Frame with Full Dual Suspension: Easy mounting with front and rear suspension for maximum comfort\n\n3000W Peak Power: Geared hub motor tackles any hill or trail\n\nPerfect For\n\nThe step-thru design makes the Cruiser ideal for riders of all ages and abilities who want easy mounting and dismounting without sacrificing performance or safety. Whether you're commuting, trail riding, or exploring, the full dual suspension system delivers a smooth, comfortable ride on any terrain with UL2849 and UL2271 certified safety.\n\nUnmatched Value & Safety\n\nYou will not find a better valued step-thru electric bike with full dual suspension, dual battery system, and UL2849/UL2271 certifications available on the market. The WIRED Cruiser delivers premium features and industry-leading safety at an exceptional price point.",
